																		Two Forgetful Men
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kamelen800" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3484162); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3484162&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606834596" alt="kamelen800" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3484162)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kamelen800" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3484162); return false;" >kamelen800</a></span> <span class="odate time_1556554684 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">29 Apr 2019 16:18</span>
														</div>
