			<div class="content" id="post-content-4233208">
									

<p>So this was an SCP file made by me, with critique from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aismallard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4598089); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4598089&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1556704033" alt="aismallard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4598089)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aismallard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4598089); return false;">aismallard</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/macwarren" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3741977); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3741977&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1556704033" alt="MacWarren" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3741977)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/macwarren" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3741977); return false;">MacWarren</a></span> here on the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/c-50864/help:drafts-and-critiques">Drafts and Critiques forum</a> and RadioactiveRADs, Henzoid, AwooIsMyName, rura, DeltaMagnatude and psychicProgrammer on the r/SCPDeclassified discord server.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Show&nbsp;image&nbsp;credits</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Hide</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Special:Search&amp;limit=20&amp;offset=40&amp;profile=default&amp;search=indiana+forest&amp;advancedSearch-current={%22namespaces%22:[6,12,14,100,106,0]}#/media/File:Hoosier_National_Forest.png">header</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/man-smiling-1605399/">west</a></p>
<p>The first is under creative commons 3.0 and the second is considered &quot;free to use&quot; with &quot;no attribution required&quot; on its website.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>This took a while to write and get finished, and i've learned a lot from it. I'd argue that this is much better than <a href="/scp-4227">SCP-4227</a>, my previous finished file. Between that and this one, I went through writing 3 fully finished files which were never posted. This file was inspired by the SCP files <a href="/wmdd-s-proposal">wmdd-s-proposal</a>, <a href="/djkaktus-s-proposal">djkaktus-s-proposal</a>, <a href="/scp-3999">SCP-3999</a> and <a href="/scp-3001">SCP-3001</a>, and the <a href="/letters-to-my-future-self">letters-to-my-future-self</a> tale, which it, to be honest, the file was the most heavily inspired from. It also used a document format for one of the addenda, which was taken from <a href="/djkaktus-s-proposal">djkaktus-s-proposal</a>, but altered slightly.</p>
<p>Edit: Also changed the text PNGs so that they're real text instead, to make thing more practical for people using text to speech and similar things. This was done using a format from <a href="/scp-style-resource">scp-style-resource</a>. This format was made by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1556704033" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span>.</p>

