<p>Nothing bad from me, I quite liked it.<br />
I do have a few questions though.</p>
<p>Addendum 4375.3: Recovery Logs.<br />
Here you list the MTF members in the operation, while in the logs you add &quot;P-1&#160;8&quot; whom was not mentioned. Is this intentional?</p>
<p>Addendum 4375.7: Notable Field Operations<br />
The last 2 operations are both referred to as &quot;XI&quot; but have different dates.<br />
Is this intentional?</p>
<p>Generic question:<br />
The researcher and security guard found the anomaly, which happened to be near to where they lived. Aren't site staff provided housing near, or onsite? Might be a canon thing, im just unsure.</p>
<p>Also, &quot;The Ethics Committee&quot; sound rather barbaric in it's regards to either brainwashing or killing the doctor all the while employing their new reality bender as a weapon. Not sure this is the way they'd handle this.</p>
<p>BUT, all in all. I liked reading it. Plenty of logs, which I am a sucker for.<br />
+1</p>

