			<div class="content" id="post-content-4242429">
									

<p>+1, but&#8230;<br />
The Ethics committee is supposed to serve as a check/balance on the power of the O5s, and ensure ethical treatment of sentient and sapient SCPs (excluding outstanding circumstances, like SCP-231<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-523925-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-523925-1')">1</a></sup>). However, here, the Ethics Committee is portrayed here as overtly sadistic and monstrous<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-523925-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-523925-2')">2</a></sup>. Usually, the Ethics Committee is overridden by the O5 council, or their review is exempted by a Thaumiel classification, due to the anomaly's importance to the accomplishment of the Foundation's mission, but in the case of SCP-4375, there are more powerful, complicit reality benders to fill this role, and SRAs, which invalidates the grossly unethical actions detailed here.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>OPERATION XI | &lt;10/09/2017&gt;</strong><br />
<strong>Subject:</strong> Foundation enemies<br />
<strong>Description:</strong> SCP-4375-1 was used to terminate traitorous Foundation members and implanted Chaos Insurgency members.<br />
<strong>Notes:</strong> [DATA REDACTED]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I enjoy a good conspiracy-esque narrative, and this is just that: but it clashes with the general operating methods of the Foundation.</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-523925-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-523925-1')">1</a>. Although, given that the O5 council and Ethics Committee know about SCP-2317, they are overstepping the Foundation's ethical bounds in that article too.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-523925-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-523925-2')">2</a>. See quote below.</div>
</div>

